From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jerry Zhao <jerryz123@berkeley.edu>
Subject: [PATCH] Delegate only implemented hypervisor interrupts
Purpose: Keeps mideleg.SGEIP zero when no guest external interrupt is implemented.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

The pinned Spike model exposes read-only-zero hgeip and hgeie, so GEILEN is
zero. H still requires the three VS-level interrupt delegation bits to read
one, but only requires SGEIP delegation when GEILEN is nonzero.

diff --git a/riscv/encoding.h b/riscv/encoding.h
--- a/riscv/encoding.h
+++ b/riscv/encoding.h
@@ -179,5 +179,5 @@
 #define MIP_HS_MASK         (MIP_VS_MASK | MIP_SGEIP)
 
-#define MIDELEG_FORCED_MASK MIP_HS_MASK
+#define MIDELEG_FORCED_MASK MIP_VS_MASK
 
 #define SIP_SSIP MIP_SSIP
